        </p>

        <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-center gap-4">
            <a href="contact.html" class="w-full sm:w-auto bg-gradient-to-r from-indigo-600 to-cyan-500 hover:opacity-90 text-white font-bold text-sm px-8 py-3.5 rounded-xl shadow-xl shadow-indigo-500/20 transition flex items-center justify-center gap-2">
                <span>Book a Free Consultation</span>
                <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right text-xs"></i>
